    "en": "Registration of United Kingdom Patents Act\n(Chapter 271, Section 2)\nAppointment of Registrar of Patents\nN 1\nG.N. No. S 1222/1962\nREVISED EDITION 1990\n(25th March 1992)\n[16th July 1962]\nThe Registrar of Trade Marks has been appointed to be the Registrar of Patents for the purposes of the Act."
